with food allergies.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2023-2024: S6820B/A7494B - Died in Rules/Passed Assembly\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the State.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect one year after it shall have become a law.\n",
